<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - America Online off priority list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - America Online off priority list.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it removed America Online Inc from its priority list, but kept the stock on the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Goldman analyst Michael Parekh said the firm reiterated that America Online remains the favorite stock in the internet services/online group.</p>
<p>-- said America Online's fundamentals remain strong.</p>
<p>-- America Online closed Thursday at 67-12/16.</p>
</text>
